# Data, by lifecycle. Committed only where it is small, curated, and not reproducible.
#
#   private-profiles/  IMPORTED — one directory per profile; regenerate via REFRESH_PARQET_DATA.md.
#                          Ignored: holds real position values and share counts.
#   gen_prices/ DERIVED  — regenerate via update_prices.py. Ignored: bulk, and reproducible from
#   gen_fx/     DERIVED    registry/price_sources.csv alone.
#   registry/   CURATED  — COMMITTED. Two small tables no import can rebuild. Note that
#                          instruments.csv does enumerate which instruments are held.
*.csv
gen_prices/
gen_fx/
!registry/*.csv

# Any directory named private* — private-profiles/ today, and a catch-all for anything else added
# under that naming convention later, so a new folder is safe by default rather than needing its
# own line here first.
private*/

# check_portfolio.js records real position values and tooltips here, one file per profile —
# same rule as private-profiles/
check_baseline*.json

.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# a trading agent's own working files (memory, strategy, notes) — agents/<name>/var/
agents/*/var/
